// SPAR — five-layer architecture
// Paste into eraser.io → New architecture diagram
direction down
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

title SPAR Five Layer Architecture [icon: layers, color: indigo]

Shock [icon: alert-triangle, color: orange, label: "Macro / policy shock"]

L0 [icon: search, color: blue] {
  Profiler [icon: activity, color: blue, label: "0a Shock profiler"]
  Channels [icon: git-branch, color: blue, label: "0b Channel decomposer"]
  Evidence [icon: file-text, color: blue, label: "Per-agent evidence packets"]
}

L1 [icon: users, color: green] {
  Pol [icon: globe, color: green, label: "Political / Geo"]
  Eco [icon: trending-up, color: green, label: "Economic / Market"]
  Env [icon: cpu, color: green, label: "Env / Tech"]
  Soc [icon: heart, color: green, label: "Social / Behav"]
  DA [icon: shield, color: red, label: "Devils Advocate"]
}

DCS [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "DCS controller\n0.40 DS + 0.40 IG + 0.20 (1-RE)"]

L2 [icon: check-circle, color: orange] {
  Consensus [icon: file, color: orange, label: "Consensus JSON"]
  Dissent [icon: message-square, color: orange, label: "Minority dissent"]
  Gate [icon: filter, color: orange, label: "Plausibility gate PS>=60"]
}

L3 [icon: bar-chart-2, color: teal] {
  FF [icon: percent, color: teal, label: "Factor model + GPR"]
  Risk [icon: alert-circle, color: teal, label: "VaR / ES"]
  Hedge [icon: lock, color: teal, label: "GLD / TLT + cash"]
}

Shock > L0: Layer 0 evidence
L0 > Pol, Eco, Env, Soc, DA: Domain packets
Pol, Eco, Env, Soc, DA > DCS: After each live round
DCS > Pol: EXPLORE another round [color: green]
DCS > L2: EXPLOIT synthesise [color: orange]
L2 > Gate
Gate > L3: CLEARED
Gate > Human [icon: user, color: grey]: PS < 60 review

legend [position: bottom] {
  [color: blue, label: "Layer 0 evidence"]
  [color: green, label: "Layer 1 debate"]
  [color: purple, label: "Continuation control"]
  [color: orange, label: "Layer 2 validation"]
  [color: teal, label: "Layer 3 no LLM"]
}
